Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?S33=20T026:=20caches=20under=20assets/=20join?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20the=20stamp's=20key=20through=20the=20probe=20file,=20and=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?a=20run=20that=20cannot=20list=20them=20reuses=20nothing=20(D11?=
 =?UTF-8?q?9,=20AC-S33-13)=20(root=20Makefile=20and=20tests=20=E2=80=94=20?=
